sequenceDiagram
    participant Provider as Review Provider
    participant API as Processing API
    participant Producer as Kafka Producer
    participant PT as Processing Topic
    participant RT as Review Topic
    participant Consumer as Kafka Consumer
    participant PH as Processing Handler
    participant Worker as Async Worker
    participant RS as Review Service
    participant HS as Hotel Service
    participant AS as Analytics Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Cache as Redis
    participant DLQ as Dead Letter Queue

    %% File Upload Flow
    Provider->>API: Upload reviews file (CSV/JSON)
    API->>API: Validate file format
    API->>DB: Create processing job
    API->>Producer: Create ProcessingStartedEvent
    Producer->>PT: Publish event
    API-->>Provider: Return job ID

    %% Processing Started
    PT->>Consumer: Consume ProcessingStartedEvent
    Consumer->>PH: Handle event
    PH->>Worker: Start async processing
    
    %% File Processing
    loop For each batch
        Worker->>Worker: Read batch from file
        Worker->>RS: Validate reviews
        RS->>DB: Bulk insert reviews
        Worker->>Producer: Create ProcessingProgressEvent
        Producer->>PT: Publish progress
        
        %% Review Events
        RS->>Producer: Create ReviewBatchCreated event
        Producer->>RT: Publish event
    end

    %% Review Processing
    RT->>Consumer: Consume ReviewBatchCreated
    Consumer->>PH: Handle review event
    
    par Hotel Summary Update
        PH->>HS: Update hotel statistics
        HS->>DB: Update hotel summary
        HS->>Cache: Invalidate cache
        HS->>Producer: Create HotelSummaryUpdated
        Producer->>RT: Publish event
    and Analytics Update
        PH->>AS: Update analytics
        AS->>DB: Update analytics data
        AS->>Producer: Create HotelAnalyticsUpdated
        Producer->>RT: Publish event
    end

    %% Success Flow
    Worker->>Producer: Create ProcessingCompletedEvent
    Producer->>PT: Publish completion
    PT->>Consumer: Consume completion event
    Consumer->>PH: Handle completion
    PH->>DB: Update job status

    %% Error Handling
    alt Processing Error
        Worker->>Producer: Create ProcessingFailedEvent
        Producer->>PT: Publish failure
        PT->>Consumer: Consume failure
        Consumer->>PH: Handle failure
        
        alt Retry Available
            PH->>Producer: Create ProcessingRetryEvent
            Producer->>PT: Publish retry
        else Max Retries Exceeded
            PH->>Producer: Send to DLQ
            Producer->>DLQ: Publish to dead letter
        end
    end

    %% Monitoring Events
    note over Producer,PT: System events published throughout
    Producer->>PT: SystemHealthCheckEvent
    Producer->>PT: SystemMetricsEvent